Extraction purpose: independently runnable original canvas workspace and related APIs, project files, tabs, editors, viewers and artifact organization. The restored original Canvas/Assets/Collect surfaces include a standalone local asset library, browser capture extension and conditional native login connector. The upstream chat product, account/team platform and Agent runtime are excluded.

The asset library core, metadata and space UI, collector, extension and browser inspector are extracted and adapted from the same frozen baseline. Independent adapters, storage ownership, application/extension identities, protocol guards and lifecycle fixes are documented in the repository's architecture and parity documentation.

The adapted page-recreation skill retains its separate MIT license and provenance under resources/skills/page-recreation/. It is not relicensed by this Apache notice.
